  "body": "With the market heating up, our Vendor has instructed us to present all reasonable offers to get this section SOLD! Discover a rare opportunity to turn your dream of building your own home into a reality! This section is one of the last available sites overlooking the stunning Gulf Harbour Marina. \r\nPrepare to be transported to a destination where your vision can take shape. Whether you have grand aspirations or prefer a cosy haven, this is the place where you'll relish every moment of coming home.\r\nImagine waking up each day with the Marina and the local wildlife on display. The allure of spending holidays in the comfort of your own abode becomes irresistible. Why not make a move towards what truly moves you?\r\nWith easy connectivity to mains water, stormwater, fibre, and gas, your picture of the ideal home is beautifully completed. It's time to seize this opportunity and craft your dream dwelling in this remarkable location. Please contact the agent regarding Watercare connectivity. Take advantage of one of Auckland's most stunning environments, if you have not considered Gulf Harbour before - now is the time. Shakespear Regional Park is just down the road with Whangaparaoa Golf Course and the internationally acclaimed Golf Harbour Country Club nearby. Located close to beaches, schools (incl Wentworth College, Gulf Harbour Primary and Rainbow Corner Daycare Centre), the Gulf Harbour Marina, restaurants, cafes and ferries to the CBD. You and your family can create a lifestyle that perfectly balances business and relaxation.\r\nFor those seeking inspiration, concept drawings of a house designed to maximise the views are ready to be explored. \r\nProperty documents can be downloaded here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/Q2HTts \r\nContact us today to embark on an exciting journey towards building your own home.",
